lement\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Striding\" title=\"Striding\">Striding +15%</a>:</b> This item makes you more fleet of foot, giving you a 15% Enhancement bonus your movement speed.</span></span></li></ul>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFFACD;\" rowspan=\"5\" align=\"center\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/page/File:Mithral_Full_Plate_of_Speed_(Striding_version).png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Mithral_Full_Plate_of_Speed_%28Striding_version%29.png/420px-Mithral_Full_Plate_of_Speed_%28Striding_version%29.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"420\" height=\"579\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Mithral_Full_Plate_of_Speed_%28Striding_version%29.png 1.5x\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#F0DC82\">Upgradeable?\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFFACD\">\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#F0DC82\">Description\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFFACD\"><i>This mithral full plate is a masterpiece of armorsmithing. It has also been enchanted to increase the speed at which the wearer moves and fights in melee.</i>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#F0DC82\">Notes\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFFACD\">\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#F0DC82\">Tips\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFFACD\">\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260817054828\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.072 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.126 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 3142/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 21656/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 